      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KEAYANG VIPER (9) made it two wins on the trot with a hit-and run success at Menangle last time out, getting home by a neck to take her record to six from eight. Draws on the back row but she is good enough to overcome that. SAVON DE ROCHE (8) added to a string of wins and placings at her latest appearance when she led and dug deep to score by 1.2 metres at this circuit and distance. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and the sprint lane is in play so she could salute again. SPOOK CROCKER (4) led from this barrier for a winning return at Mt Gambier. Stronger here but should be fitter so could take the next step. A better draw can see an improved showing from PISTOL PEARCE (3).",
